{"html":"\u003c!doctype html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003ctitle\u003eYour Regnovum password was changed\u003c/title\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi, Baseline Ana\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour account password was changed and every older session was ended. If this was not you, reset your password now and review the active sessions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regnovum team\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","subject":"Your Regnovum password was changed","text":"Hi, Baseline Ana\n\nYour account password was changed and every older session was ended. If this was not you, reset your password now and review the active sessions.\n\nThe Regnovum team"}